Copyright 2024-2026 The mini_tree Authors

This product includes software developed for the mini_tree embedded
middleware project. The primary license is Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.

This distribution also includes third-party open-source components under
their own licenses. Infrastructure libraries are vendored under lib/;
optional bricks are fetched on demand via CMake FetchContent (see
cmake/dep_fetch.cmake) unless a local lib/<Name> checkout is present.
mini_tree does not vendor commercial closed-source stacks.

