  - RT-Thread (Apache-2.0)
      Location: lib/rtthread/

  - TinyUSB (MIT)
      Location: lib/tinyusb/
      Copyright (c) 2012-2026, Ha Thach (tinyusb.org)
      See also nested licenses under lib/tinyusb/.

  - lwIP (BSD-style)
      Location: lib/lwip/

  - cJSON (MIT)
      Location: lib/cJSON/

  - Embedded Template Library / ETL (MIT)
      Location: lib/etl/
      Upper-layer C++ base; always linked into mini_tree (SYSTEM_CPP)

